<title>ITALY: Fiat group new car registrations up in June.</title>
<headline>Fiat group new car registrations up in June.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fiat Auto new car registrations in Italy in June totalled 102,100, up 65.8 percent on 61,586 in June 1996, figures from the Italian Transport Ministry showed.</p>
<p>Fiat comprises Fiat, Alfa Romeo, Lancia Autobianchi, and Fiat-Innocenti.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129589</p>
</text>
